    "directions": [
      "In a mortar pestle, add ginger, green chillies, cumin seeds and grind it into coarse paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a handi, add mustard oil, once it's hot, add black cardamom, bay leaf, prepared ginger green chilli paste and saute it for a minute.",
      "Add onions and cook it for a while until golden in colour.",
      "Add curd mixture and let it cook for 7-8 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Add a little water, marinated chicken, cover it with the lid and cook it for a while.",
      "Add water, salt to taste and simmer it for 5-6 minutes until it thickens.",
      "Turn off the flames and finish it with coriander leaves.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti, steam rice and prepared raita.",
      "In a bowl, add curd, turmeric powder, degi red chili powder, coriander powder, ginger garlic paste and give it a good mix.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add chicken, crushed black peppercorns, lemon juice, salt to taste, turmeric powder and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside to marinate for a while.",
      "In a bowl, add curd, cucumber, tomato, onions, salt to taste, lemon juice, roasted cumin powder, coriander leaves, degi red chili powder and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "In a saucepan, add water, tea leaves, sugar, ginger and boil it for 4-5 minutes.",
      "Add milk and simmer it for 5-6 minutes.",
      "Transfer it to a serving cup and Serve hot."
    ],
